1
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:06,270
(Sheldon:)Hello, I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

2
00:00:06,439 --> 00:00:10,239
(Penny:)Welcome to
Sheldon Cooper Presents Fun With Flags.

3
00:00:11,845 --> 00:00:12,935
Before we get started...

4
00:00:13,113 --> 00:00:16,773
...I'd like to announce the winner of our
"design your own flag" competition...

5
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,610
...but I can't.

6
00:00:18,785 --> 00:00:24,655
The only entry was from GameyGamer75,
I know that was a JPEG of your buttocks.

7
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:28,292
Now, this week,
we have a very special episode...

8
00:00:28,461 --> 00:00:32,921
(Sheldon:)...where we explore the flags of the popular
entertainment franchise Star Trek.

9
00:00:33,099 --> 00:00:37,059
And to help me, I'm pleased to introduce
Internet personality...

10
00:00:37,237 --> 00:00:39,997
...former star of
Star Trek: The Next Generation...

11
00:00:40,173 --> 00:00:45,513
...and the only guy I know lucky enough
to be immortalized in one-sixteenth scale.

12
00:00:45,678 --> 00:00:48,008
Set phasers to "fun"...

13
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:53,120
...for my friend Wil Wheaton.

14
00:00:55,188 --> 00:00:57,778
- Hi, thanks for having me. Happy to be here.
- Cut.

15
00:00:59,526 --> 00:01:03,026
- What's wrong?
- Sorry, you were brilliant as always.

